  "solution": "By Vieta’s formulas for the cubic\n\n\\[\nx^3-20x^2+18x-7=0,\n\\]\n\nwhose roots are \\(r,s,t\\), we have\n\n\\[\nr+s+t=20,\n\\]\n\\[\nrs+rt+st=18,\n\\]\n\\[\nrst=7.\n\\]\n\nNow expand:\n\n\\[\n(1+r)(1+s)(1+t)\n= 1+(r+s+t)+(rs+rt+st)+rst.\n\\]\n\nSubstitute the values:\n\n\\[\n(1+r)(1+s)(1+t)=1+20+18+7=46.\n\\]\n\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{46}\\).",
